{"seq":3,"slug":"haptic-signal-model","title":"触觉信号模型：把震动当作可计算的时域波形","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-haptics-feedback/foundations/haptic-signal-model","wordCount":1457,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"触觉信号模型-把震动当作可计算的时域波形\">触觉信号模型：把震动当作可计算的时域波形</h1><p>当美术说&quot;这记命中要更脆一点&quot;，程序员需要把这句感性的话翻译成具体的数字：上升要更快、高频成分要更多、整体时长要更短。能做这种翻译的前提是有一个把触觉表示成可计算对象的模型。这一篇建立本 hub 的通用语言——把任意触觉效果拆成振幅、频率、包络三个可独立操纵的维度，后面设计、混音、音转触全都在这个模型上运算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-触觉效果-载波-包络\">核心概念：触觉效果 = 载波 × 包络</h2><p>最实用的触觉信号模型借自音频合成：一个触觉效果是一个被包络调制的振动载波。载波决定&quot;震的是什么频率的颤动&quot;，包络决定&quot;这股颤动如何随时间起落&quot;。形式化地，瞬时触觉位移 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 可写成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h(t) = A(t)\\cdot \\sin\\!\\big(2\\pi f(t)\\, t + \\phi\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是随时间变化的振幅包络，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是（可能时变的）频率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span></span></span></span></span> 是相位。一记&quot;脆&quot;的命中就是包络上升极快、频率偏高、整体很短；一段引擎轰鸣则是包络持续、频率较低、还叠了点随机扰动。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    EVENT[游戏事件&lt;br/&gt;命中/受击] --&gt; CARRIER[选择载波&lt;br/&gt;频率 f]&#10;    EVENT --&gt; ENV[设计包络 A t&lt;br/&gt;ADSR]&#10;    CARRIER --&gt; MOD[载波 × 包络]&#10;    ENV --&gt; MOD&#10;    MOD --&gt; PRIM[原语序列&lt;br/&gt;瞬态 + 连续]&#10;    PRIM --&gt; RENDER[平台渲染器]&#10;    RENDER --&gt; HW[作动器&lt;br/&gt;受频段能力约束]\">flowchart TD\n    EVENT[游戏事件&lt;br/&gt;命中/受击] --&gt; CARRIER[选择载波&lt;br/&gt;频率 f]\n    EVENT --&gt; ENV[设计包络 A t&lt;br/&gt;ADSR]\n    CARRIER --&gt; MOD[载波 × 包络]\n    ENV --&gt; MOD\n    MOD --&gt; PRIM[原语序列&lt;br/&gt;瞬态 + 连续]\n    PRIM --&gt; RENDER[平台渲染器]\n    RENDER --&gt; HW[作动器&lt;br/&gt;受频段能力约束]</pre><p>注意最后一步：渲染要受作动器物理能力约束，模型里写得出的频率不一定播得出，作动器的边界见<a href=\"haptic-hardware\">触觉硬件</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>控制什么</th>\n<th>感知效果</th>\n<th>典型取值范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>振幅 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>强度</td>\n<td>轻/重</td>\n<td>按对数映射到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\text{–}1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>频率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>颤动快慢</td>\n<td>粗糙/细腻</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>1000</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>Hz</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20\\text{–}1000\\,\\text{Hz}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Hz</span></span></span></span></span></span>（受作动器限制）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>包络 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>时间形状</td>\n<td>脆/绵/渐强</td>\n<td>ADSR 各段毫秒级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时长</td>\n<td>持续</td>\n<td>瞬态/连续</td>\n<td>瞬态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>50</mn><mtext>ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;50\\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span>，连续可任意</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"两类原语-瞬态与连续\">两类原语：瞬态与连续</h2><p>几乎所有平台 API 都把触觉拆成两种基本原语，理解这个二分是写跨平台资产的起点。**瞬态（transient）**是一个发生在特定时刻的短促冲击，包络是一根尖峰，对应&quot;咔哒&quot;这样的离散事件——开关、命中、脚步落地。**连续（continuous）**是一段可持续的振动，包络可在播放期间实时调制，对应引擎轰鸣、持续受击、能量充能这类延展状态。</p>\n<p>iOS Core Haptics 直接用这两个词命名事件类型（<code>hapticTransient</code> 与 <code>hapticContinuous</code>），且二者要完全独立处理时甚至需要两个独立的 AHAP 播放器（来源：Apple Developer 文档，developer.apple.com/documentation/corehaptics）。这个二分在每个平台都成立，是触觉资产可移植的最小公约数。一个复杂效果（如换弹）通常是若干瞬态加一段连续的组合：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>弹匣脱出：瞬态，强、高频</li>\n<li>推入新弹匣：一段短连续，中频，包络渐弱</li>\n<li>拉栓到位：瞬态，最强、最脆</li>\n</ul>\n<p>把效果拆成原语序列后，跨平台渲染只需把每个原语映射到目标平台对应的 API 调用，这是<a href=\"../systems/event-driven-haptics\">事件驱动触觉</a>里资源播放的基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"包络-adsr-如何决定手感\">包络：ADSR 如何决定手感</h2><p>包络 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是决定&quot;手感&quot;最关键的维度，而它的工业标准描述就是音频合成里的 ADSR——起音（Attack）、衰减（Decay）、延音（Sustain）、释音（Release）。这个借用不是比喻，触觉与音频共享时域信号本质，详细的类比关系见<a href=\"../design/haptics-audio-analogy\">触觉与音频类比</a>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Attack</strong>：从零升到峰值的时间。越短越&quot;脆&quot;——命中、瞬态的 attack 往往只有一两毫秒。</li>\n<li><strong>Decay</strong>：从峰值落到延音电平的时间。</li>\n<li><strong>Sustain</strong>：持续段的稳定电平，瞬态几乎没有 sustain，连续效果靠它撑起时长。</li>\n<li><strong>Release</strong>：从延音回到零的时间。release 太短会&quot;断&quot;得突兀，太长会&quot;拖&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>同样峰值与频率，只改 attack 从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20\\,\\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\,\\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span>，玩家就会从&quot;绵软的推力&quot;感知成&quot;清脆的撞击&quot;。这正是程序员把&quot;更脆一点&quot;翻译成可执行参数的地方：缩短 attack、抬高高频成分、压缩总时长。</p>\n<h2 id=\"强度映射-把游戏数值变成振幅\">强度映射：把游戏数值变成振幅</h2><p>游戏里要震的强度往往来自某个数值——伤害大小、速度、距离。直接把数值线性映射到振幅 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 是新手最常犯的错，因为感知是对数压缩的（<a href=\"why-haptics\">为何触觉反馈</a>中的费希纳定律）。正确做法是按响度感知映射，常用形式是把归一化数值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\in[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 经一条凹曲线压到振幅：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>γ</mi></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>γ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.4</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>0.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A = A_{\\min} + (A_{\\max}-A_{\\min})\\cdot x^{\\gamma},\\quad \\gamma \\approx 0.4\\text{–}0.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9088em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.4</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 让弱档拉开、强档收拢，抵消对数压缩，使玩家在整个数值范围内都能感到大致均匀的强度变化。此外要设一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 阈值，低于感知阈值的震动等于浪费功耗还可能造成&quot;半震不震&quot;的廉价感。强度档位也别超过七到十级，多了玩家也分不出。如何把这些参数做成可调、可降级、可被玩家覆盖，是<a href=\"../design/haptic-restraint\">节制与疲劳</a>与<a href=\"../practice/haptics-accessibility\">触觉与可访问性</a>关心的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>触觉效果建模为&quot;载波 × 包络&quot;：振幅控强度、频率控粗糙细腻、包络控时间形状。</li>\n<li>两类原语瞬态与连续是跨平台最小公约数，复杂效果是原语序列的组合。</li>\n<li>包络用 ADSR 描述，attack 时长是决定&quot;脆/绵&quot;手感的最关键参数。</li>\n<li>游戏数值到振幅要按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>γ</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma\\approx0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6776em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span>）的凹曲线映射并设最小阈值，抵消感知的对数压缩。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>哪些频率/包络实际播得出，受作动器约束：<a href=\"haptic-hardware\">触觉硬件</a></li>\n<li>ADSR 与混音思路的完整音频类比：<a href=\"../design/haptics-audio-analogy\">触觉与音频类比</a></li>\n<li>把原语序列在运行时调度播放：<a href=\"../systems/event-driven-haptics\">事件驱动触觉</a></li>\n<li>跨库：包络与合成的音频源头见 <a href=\"../../game-audio/sound-design/synthesis-sampling\">合成与采样</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"触觉信号模型：把震动当作可计算的时域波形","id":"触觉信号模型-把震动当作可计算的时域波形"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：触觉效果 = 载波 × 包络","id":"核心概念-触觉效果-载波-包络"},{"level":2,"text":"两类原语：瞬态与连续","id":"两类原语-瞬态与连续"},{"level":2,"text":"包络：ADSR 如何决定手感","id":"包络-adsr-如何决定手感"},{"level":2,"text":"强度映射：把游戏数值变成振幅","id":"强度映射-把游戏数值变成振幅"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"触觉硬件：从偏心转子到音圈与可编程阻力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-haptics-feedback/foundations/haptic-hardware"},"next":{"title":"触觉设计语言：让掌心读懂游戏状态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-haptics-feedback/design/haptic-design-language"}}